    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics has always been a challenging subject for me, but I appreciate its logical structure. While it's not my favorite topic, I recognize its importance in problem-solving and everyday life. My background in literature and philosophy makes me approach math from a more abstract perspective, which sometimes helps me see connections others might miss.",
